WEBVTT

01:30.550 --> 01:34.910
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.190 --> 01:37.729
[Episode 39]

02:17.840 --> 02:19.300
Are there any demons left?

02:20.590 --> 02:22.150
You're too late.

02:24.079 --> 02:26.930
The humans have taken everything
worth taking.

02:27.079 --> 02:28.800
I'm the only one left—

02:29.960 --> 02:32.090
an old demon with no spiritual energy.

02:33.190 --> 02:34.680
How long have you been here?

02:34.680 --> 02:36.120
I've lived too long.

02:37.170 --> 02:38.890
I've forgotten the time.

02:41.190 --> 02:42.520
Which clan are you from?

02:45.630 --> 02:46.840
I'm too old.

02:48.600 --> 02:50.530
I've forgotten my clan's name too.

02:52.850 --> 02:55.690
What's the use of remembering anyway?

02:58.710 --> 03:00.000
I am the last member

03:01.010 --> 03:02.370
of my clan.

03:04.280 --> 03:05.560
All of my clansmen

03:06.370 --> 03:07.640
were killed

03:08.470 --> 03:09.800
a long time ago.

03:11.360 --> 03:12.870
I'm the only one left,

03:13.740 --> 03:16.540
surviving in hiding until now.

03:19.810 --> 03:21.140
When I die,

03:23.310 --> 03:24.560
my clan

03:25.520 --> 03:26.560
will disappear

03:27.560 --> 03:29.120
from this world.

03:34.660 --> 03:35.370
Old Sir.

03:42.320 --> 03:43.290
Is your clan

03:43.710 --> 03:44.710
Qiong Qi?

03:48.120 --> 03:50.960
I haven't heard that name in a long time.

03:52.840 --> 03:55.900
I thought the world
had forgotten the Qiong Qi.

04:00.320 --> 04:00.990
Wait.

04:02.360 --> 04:04.030
I think I've seen you before.

04:07.360 --> 04:08.870
You seem familiar.

04:19.360 --> 04:21.950
The Qiong Qi King is still alive.

04:29.310 --> 04:31.640
The Qiong Qi King is still alive!

04:33.540 --> 04:36.040
I'm not the only Qiong Qi left!

04:47.320 --> 04:50.120
I'm not the only Qiong Qi left!

04:59.680 --> 05:00.370
Old Sir.

05:04.800 --> 05:05.390
Old Sir!

05:24.180 --> 05:26.580
The Primordial Pearl has become like this.

05:27.640 --> 05:29.050
Is your name really

05:31.720 --> 05:32.380
just "Old"?

05:40.040 --> 05:41.550
Human cowards!

05:55.030 --> 05:55.960
Set up the array!

08:56.910 --> 08:57.510
Thank you.

09:05.470 --> 09:07.270
What about what you promised me?

09:14.020 --> 09:15.880
It's been too long since I carved.

09:16.810 --> 09:18.410
My hands are a bit clumsy now.

09:24.560 --> 09:25.380
I knew it.

09:28.490 --> 09:29.660
The one you love

09:31.530 --> 09:33.880
is still the old Pianpian.

09:40.000 --> 09:41.550
Since I changed my heart,

09:43.600 --> 09:45.800
you've never called me Pianpian again.

09:51.540 --> 09:53.140
I can never go back.

09:57.310 --> 09:58.660
But you're different.

10:00.540 --> 10:01.870
You still have a chance.

10:05.080 --> 10:06.740
This is an ancient great demon

10:06.870 --> 10:08.400
with extraordinary power.

10:08.570 --> 10:11.530
The human emperor hunts demons
across the land for elixir refining,

10:11.530 --> 10:14.400
but doesn't have even a tenth
of an ancient demon's power.

10:14.400 --> 10:16.400
While his power hasn't dissipated,

10:16.910 --> 10:18.840
if you consume his heart now,

10:19.290 --> 10:21.020
you can gain his power,

10:21.320 --> 10:22.580
strengthen yourself,

10:23.360 --> 10:24.760
and fight the Demon King.

10:35.740 --> 10:37.690
If I consume a demon's heart,

10:40.310 --> 10:42.030
am I still human

10:43.870 --> 10:44.600
or a demon?

10:44.600 --> 10:46.910
I'll tell you my second wish now.

10:49.020 --> 10:50.560
You must become stronger

10:52.390 --> 10:53.870
so I won't lose you

10:53.870 --> 10:55.530
in the battle against demons.

10:59.370 --> 11:00.360
You said

11:02.320 --> 11:04.180
you would take care of me for life.

11:11.030 --> 11:12.760
I want you to keep that promise!

13:27.010 --> 13:28.120
This beach

13:28.590 --> 13:29.470
and sea

13:30.120 --> 13:32.120
is just like it was 10,000 years ago—

13:32.630 --> 13:34.030
it hasn't changed at all.

13:36.180 --> 13:38.050
Since the day I was born,

13:39.640 --> 13:42.500
I've had an irreconcilable stance
against humans.

13:43.490 --> 13:45.220
But only today did I learn

13:46.660 --> 13:47.920
that I am human myself.

13:49.630 --> 13:51.510
And the one who caused humans and demons

13:51.510 --> 13:53.080
to fight for 10,000 years,

13:54.870 --> 13:56.030
turned out to be me.

14:04.220 --> 14:05.450
The root cause of the conflict

14:05.450 --> 14:06.630
is the Yuli Spring.

14:08.010 --> 14:09.340
For thousands of years,

14:09.440 --> 14:11.370
you've been atoning for your sins.

14:12.020 --> 14:13.480
What you owed to the demons

14:14.240 --> 14:15.200
has been repaid.

14:17.480 --> 14:19.540
You say that over these 10,000 years,

14:19.720 --> 14:20.920
everything changed.

14:22.100 --> 14:24.210
But the sea and the beach didn't.

14:27.030 --> 14:29.030
But there is actually one more thing

14:29.450 --> 14:30.910
that has remained the same

14:31.750 --> 14:33.210
as it was 10,000 years ago—

14:43.340 --> 14:44.570
my love for you.

15:16.200 --> 15:18.860
This is the Dragon Essence Pearl
from back then.

15:19.240 --> 15:20.430
It represents

15:21.520 --> 15:22.120
life.

15:39.360 --> 15:40.670
Humans.

16:02.870 --> 16:04.120
What happened to

16:04.790 --> 16:06.720
Mount Fajiu?

16:10.150 --> 16:11.570
Hello?

16:12.750 --> 16:14.630
Is anyone alive?

16:17.630 --> 16:20.720
Hello?

16:22.150 --> 16:23.630
How strange.

16:35.000 --> 16:37.960
Why do you look so healthy?

16:38.550 --> 16:40.000
You must be an immortal.

16:44.030 --> 16:45.160
I'm not an immortal.

16:48.630 --> 16:49.750
I'm a demon.

16:58.550 --> 16:59.610
It doesn't matter.

17:01.750 --> 17:03.480
We're all going to die anyway.

17:05.160 --> 17:06.599
You're not afraid of me?

17:07.750 --> 17:08.550
How boring.

17:11.109 --> 17:11.910
Let me ask you.

17:12.589 --> 17:13.589
Did some disaster

17:13.720 --> 17:15.310
strike this place?

17:17.400 --> 17:18.440
A plague...

17:19.960 --> 17:20.750
A plague?

17:22.109 --> 17:24.170
What kind of plague could be this bad?

17:24.640 --> 17:26.300
There were too many disasters

17:26.640 --> 17:28.250
all year round.

17:28.960 --> 17:30.350
When floods came,

17:31.350 --> 17:32.920
we fled to the mountains.

17:33.960 --> 17:35.440
When locusts came,

17:36.760 --> 17:39.020
we spent day and night
driving them away.

17:40.000 --> 17:41.590
We worked so hard,

17:42.110 --> 17:44.200
yet harvested barely any grain.

17:46.230 --> 17:48.490
When there was a heavy rain
a few days ago,

17:49.070 --> 17:52.200
a winged python was flushed down.

17:54.200 --> 17:55.000
And then?

17:55.920 --> 17:57.440
It was already dead.

17:58.270 --> 18:00.670
The villagers were desperate with hunger,

18:01.720 --> 18:03.750
so they skinned the python

18:04.790 --> 18:06.660
and made soup to share.

18:09.000 --> 18:10.380
But the next day,

18:11.000 --> 18:13.290
a plague broke out in the village.

18:14.350 --> 18:15.680
Within three days,

18:17.350 --> 18:20.990
everyone in the village had died.

18:22.900 --> 18:24.100
That wasn't a python.

18:26.190 --> 18:27.850
It was one of the Teng She clan.

18:31.880 --> 18:33.680
You shared a meal of demon flesh.

18:33.830 --> 18:35.780
You deserved this calamity!

18:38.590 --> 18:41.460
But that python was already dead.

18:42.750 --> 18:44.860
We needed to survive.

18:59.200 --> 19:00.380
Do you realize

19:02.880 --> 19:05.270
that might have been my last clan member?

19:12.720 --> 19:13.440
Demon Lord.

19:14.550 --> 19:17.150
Our entire village
has already been punished.

19:19.110 --> 19:20.960
I'm dying too.

19:22.270 --> 19:23.640
Could I ask you

19:24.680 --> 19:25.640
for a favor?

19:30.510 --> 19:31.920
You want me to eat you?

19:34.920 --> 19:36.270
My child!

19:37.960 --> 19:39.420
He is still in the house...

19:42.750 --> 19:43.350
Please...

19:53.200 --> 19:54.420
Please, Demon Lord,

19:54.640 --> 19:55.900
take him away from here

19:56.590 --> 19:58.160
and let him live.

20:01.480 --> 20:02.550
Aren't you afraid

20:03.350 --> 20:04.640
I'll eat him too?

20:05.720 --> 20:07.650
The child never drank python soup.

20:09.070 --> 20:11.000
He shouldn't be punished for it.

20:11.960 --> 20:12.680
Demon Lord,

20:13.480 --> 20:15.160
you look kind-hearted.

20:15.960 --> 20:17.880
You must be a good demon.

20:18.270 --> 20:19.510
I'm begging you.

20:21.590 --> 20:23.680
Please save a life.

20:42.790 --> 20:43.880
A good demon?

20:46.710 --> 20:47.970
Demons who save humans

20:50.260 --> 20:51.830
never meet a good end.

21:37.460 --> 21:38.530
Little one.

21:40.070 --> 21:41.510
Then go with

21:42.280 --> 21:43.450
me.

22:02.920 --> 22:04.890
This must be the mirror fragment.

22:07.350 --> 22:08.400
Then this piece

22:11.640 --> 22:12.880
must be "Sickness."

22:39.740 --> 22:41.520
Why save that child?

22:45.640 --> 22:47.590
He has no family left.

22:48.200 --> 22:50.000
What's the point of living?

22:52.110 --> 22:53.400
That's for him

22:54.520 --> 22:55.810
to decide.

22:56.960 --> 22:57.680
I

22:59.500 --> 23:01.560
only need to make sure he stays alive.

23:06.670 --> 23:09.200
The human realm
is already full of suffering.

23:11.570 --> 23:13.900
Rather than growing up to face hardships,

23:16.360 --> 23:18.520
it's better to end it all now.

25:07.770 --> 25:08.670
Child!

25:23.550 --> 25:24.680
Don't be afraid.

25:27.720 --> 25:29.330
I'm

25:29.920 --> 25:30.830
with you...

25:34.160 --> 25:35.090
Don't be scared.

25:37.500 --> 25:40.770
I'm with you.

26:07.290 --> 26:09.630
So this is what death feels like.

26:21.360 --> 26:22.510
Sister.

26:26.790 --> 26:27.930
I really wish

26:31.310 --> 26:32.710
I could have one more

26:34.080 --> 26:36.020
good and proper drink

26:40.310 --> 26:42.310
with you.

27:00.160 --> 27:01.770
I hope in this world,

27:03.390 --> 27:05.170
you can find your place,

27:06.160 --> 27:08.160
away from conflicts and wandering,

27:09.470 --> 27:11.070
and remain true to yourself.

27:19.000 --> 27:20.130
Eliminate all evil.

28:21.590 --> 28:22.830
I'm alive again?

28:27.640 --> 28:28.570
I'm not dead yet.

28:30.830 --> 28:33.030
This is the power of the Demon King.

28:33.480 --> 28:34.480
Cut the nonsense.

28:34.640 --> 28:35.980
Go. Come with me.

28:36.340 --> 28:37.270
Where are we going?

28:37.270 --> 28:38.530
We still have a chance.

28:38.540 --> 28:40.340
Let's return to Demons' Valley.

28:41.960 --> 28:43.290
There's still a chance?

28:45.680 --> 28:46.440
Possibly.

28:48.010 --> 28:48.540
Let's go.

28:53.200 --> 28:54.880
Welcome, My Lord and Xiao Yao.

28:55.310 --> 28:56.200
You're back.

28:57.240 --> 28:58.400
Where are the others?

28:58.400 --> 29:00.110
The three of them haven't returned yet.

29:00.110 --> 29:01.640
You're the first ones back.

29:40.750 --> 29:41.310
Come out.

29:41.750 --> 29:42.590
Coming.

29:46.400 --> 29:47.130
How did it go?

29:47.550 --> 29:49.410
Did you find the mirror fragment?

29:49.480 --> 29:50.340
By asking that,

29:50.550 --> 29:52.510
I assume you've already found yours.

29:52.510 --> 29:53.110
Of course.

29:53.200 --> 29:53.930
Let me see it.

30:02.310 --> 30:03.310
What about yours?

30:05.190 --> 30:06.250
I want to see it too.

30:06.350 --> 30:07.000
Sure.

30:09.270 --> 30:10.000
Why does yours

30:10.000 --> 30:11.790
look different from mine?

30:50.400 --> 30:51.770
Such petty tricks

30:52.310 --> 30:53.920
cannot fool me.

31:01.830 --> 31:02.960
Why do you have

31:03.500 --> 31:05.580
Qiong Qi and Teng She's aura on you?

31:11.510 --> 31:12.840
Their power

31:13.440 --> 31:15.110
is now all within me.

31:16.830 --> 31:18.610
Now it's your turn.

31:23.150 --> 31:24.990
My rivals for over 10,000 years,

31:26.920 --> 31:28.300
are gone just like that.

31:36.270 --> 31:37.870
Perhaps it's for the best.

31:45.070 --> 31:46.620
From now on,

31:47.880 --> 31:49.030
with no more rivals,

31:50.510 --> 31:52.170
I have no more friends either!

33:23.640 --> 33:25.440
Hand over your mirror fragment.

33:37.810 --> 33:38.620
Take it.

34:00.050 --> 34:01.250
Let's die together!

34:08.750 --> 34:09.360
Pianpian.

34:24.710 --> 34:25.310
Pianpian.

34:26.150 --> 34:26.840
Pianpian!

34:33.070 --> 34:33.880
Pianpian.

34:50.670 --> 34:52.510
Stop wasting your power.

34:53.920 --> 34:54.960
The crystal heart

34:57.250 --> 34:58.900
is completely shattered.

35:01.150 --> 35:02.100
Don't worry.

35:02.330 --> 35:03.470
I'm still here.

35:05.190 --> 35:05.920
I'm with you.

35:09.190 --> 35:10.720
After I changed my heart...

35:11.760 --> 35:12.550
my...

35:13.280 --> 35:15.630
my chest often feels...

35:16.110 --> 35:16.680
pain.

35:18.720 --> 35:19.920
Now...

35:23.000 --> 35:24.840
I a-actually

35:25.840 --> 35:26.960
feel relieved.

35:26.960 --> 35:27.610
Pianpian.

35:27.670 --> 35:28.270
Pianpian.

35:28.280 --> 35:30.020
I'll go find the Yuli Spring

35:30.190 --> 35:31.650
and get the Kunlun Mirror.

35:31.800 --> 35:32.460
Wait for me.

35:32.680 --> 35:33.490
Bingzhu.

35:36.400 --> 35:37.350
I want

35:38.920 --> 35:40.480
to see Tan'er one more time.

35:42.550 --> 35:43.670
Can I?

36:11.300 --> 36:13.310
My last wish...

36:19.190 --> 36:20.450
is for you...

36:25.760 --> 36:26.560
and Tan'er...

36:28.050 --> 36:29.270
to be

36:31.360 --> 36:33.290
reunited.

36:40.020 --> 36:40.620
Pianpian.

36:41.600 --> 36:42.380
Pianpian!

36:44.120 --> 36:45.120
Pianpian.

36:45.140 --> 36:46.800
Pianpian, don't fall asleep.

36:47.330 --> 36:48.070
Pianpian...

36:49.030 --> 36:50.430
Please look at me.

37:03.710 --> 37:04.790
The Yuli Spring...

37:07.110 --> 37:08.890
Once I find the Yuli Spring,

37:11.440 --> 37:13.630
everything will be fine.

37:17.350 --> 37:18.470
It will.

37:29.030 --> 37:29.670
Tan'er.

37:30.730 --> 37:32.730
Please take care of Pianpian for me.

37:43.190 --> 37:44.000
Wait for me.

39:04.800 --> 39:05.610
Hong Ye.

39:07.800 --> 39:09.220
Come out now!

39:42.590 --> 39:43.260
Run!

39:52.150 --> 39:52.980
Don't go yet.

39:53.260 --> 39:55.460
Wait for Ao Hen and the others to return.

39:56.890 --> 39:58.950
I'm afraid they won't be coming back.

39:59.930 --> 40:01.830
There is only one possibility

40:02.070 --> 40:04.110
why his power has improved so rapidly.

40:04.110 --> 40:05.440
He absorbed Ao Hen,

40:05.760 --> 40:06.590
Qiong Qi,

40:08.090 --> 40:09.380
and Teng She's power.

40:12.550 --> 40:13.710
All the more you shouldn't be going out.

40:13.710 --> 40:14.510
Hong Ye,

40:15.680 --> 40:17.070
come out now.

40:17.440 --> 40:19.630
Your barrier is about to collapse.

40:25.640 --> 40:26.400
This battle

40:27.810 --> 40:29.080
is my destiny with him.

40:32.420 --> 40:33.500
Then promise me

40:34.500 --> 40:36.030
that you'll return safely.

40:57.150 --> 40:57.870
Hong Ye,

40:58.440 --> 40:59.710
if you don't come out now,

40:59.710 --> 41:00.800
Demons' Valley

41:01.550 --> 41:03.610
will perish!

41:13.190 --> 41:14.120
Don't be afraid.

41:14.230 --> 41:15.890
His Lordship will protect us.

41:36.670 --> 41:37.360
Demon King.

41:38.590 --> 41:40.530
Our two previous duels

41:40.760 --> 41:42.370
were both interrupted.

41:42.760 --> 41:43.760
This time,

41:44.630 --> 41:46.110
no one can stop us.
